{
    "title": "T-Life",
    "description": "T-Life is now the go-to app for T-Mobile. Get the latest exclusive deals from T-Mobile Tuesdays, and take advantage of all your Magenta Status benefits. You can manage your account and configure your T-Mobile Home Internet gateway. And now Scam Shield is here to help ID suspicious numbers, set up blocks for unwanted callers, report scams, and more. \r\n\r\nYou can also pay your bill, add a line to your account, and track orders straight from the app. If you need help with anything, customer care is available at the tap of a button. \r\n\r\nNot on the T-Mobile network? Sign up for Network Pass and easily experience T-Mobile\u2019s high-speed network FREE for three months, plus enjoy exclusive benefits and discounts \u2013 right from the T-Life app! Keep your number, phone, and existing carrier while you give T-Mobile\u2019s high-speed network a test drive. \r\n\r\nT-Life is the spot to manage and track your SyncUP devices. The SyncUP KIDS Watch helps parents stay connected with their kids, through real-time location tracking, communication, and emergency alerts. With SyncUP TRACKER from T-Mobile, you can track what matters most. This small device helps you keep tabs on your keys, luggage, backpack, or anything else that\u2019s important to you. See on the map in near real-time from virtually anywhere using T-Life.\r\n\r\nNetwork Pass: During congestion, customers on this plan using > 50GB/ mo. may notice reduced speeds until next bill cycle due to data prioritization. Non-T-Mobile customers only; 1 trial per user. Compatible unlocked device required; coverage not available in some areas. Some uses may require certain plan or feature; see plan for details.",
    "descriptionHTML": "T-Life is now the go-to app for T-Mobile. Get the latest exclusive deals from T-Mobile Tuesdays, and take advantage of all your Magenta Status benefits. You can manage your account and configure your T-Mobile Home Internet gateway. And now Scam Shield is here to help ID suspicious numbers, set up blocks for unwanted callers, report scams, and more. <br><br>You can also pay your bill, add a line to your account, and track orders straight from the app. If you need help with anything, customer care is available at the tap of a button. <br><br>Not on the T-Mobile network? Sign up for Network Pass and easily experience T-Mobile\u2019s high-speed network FREE for three months, plus enjoy exclusive benefits and discounts \u2013 right from the T-Life app! Keep your number, phone, and existing carrier while you give T-Mobile\u2019s high-speed network a test drive. <br><br>T-Life is the spot to manage and track your SyncUP devices. The SyncUP KIDS Watch helps parents stay connected with their kids, through real-time location tracking, communication, and emergency alerts. With SyncUP TRACKER from T-Mobile, you can track what matters most. This small device helps you keep tabs on your keys, luggage, backpack, or anything else that\u2019s important to you. See on the map in near real-time from virtually anywhere using T-Life.<br><br>Network Pass: During congestion, customers on this plan using &gt; 50GB/ mo. may notice reduced speeds until next bill cycle due to data prioritization. Non-T-Mobile customers only; 1 trial per user. Compatible unlocked device required; coverage not available in some areas. Some uses may require certain plan or feature; see plan for details.",
